title: "from-space-to-sediment: screening e-waste sites from satellite data and attributing river contamination in Thailand"
abstract: >-
  Open framework and code for screening candidate e-waste processing and dumping
  sites in Thailand with multi-sensor satellite data (Google Earth Engine),
  verifying them against the factory registry and public records, and
  attributing river contamination to upstream sources along the river network,
  with the Bang Pakong basin as the case study. Includes simulation-based
  validation on the real Bang Pakong network.
type: software
